":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Hexenzirkel_70690/Q7069003","priority":5,"questId":70070,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":706900301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":1435874466,"text":"Oh? You finished sorting already? That went much faster then I expected.","nextNodeIds":[706900302]},{"nodeId":706900302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":1374361786,"text":"Now then, what would you like in return, cutie? You freed up my whole afternoon, helping me with that. How about we spend it together?","nextNodeIds":[706900303,706900305]},{"nodeId":706900303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2986011738,"text":"I'd like to be paid...","nextNodeIds":[706900304]},{"nodeId":706900304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":1028079346,"text":"Oh, that's all? Well, don't worry. I won't forget.","nextNodeIds":[706900306]},{"nodeId":706900306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":2155154314,"text":"Ah, so you noticed, too. Such strange names, and even stranger contents...","nextNodeIds":[706900307]},{"nodeId":706900307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":2378764618,"text":"Not to mention, this is the largest library in northern Teyvat, and I didn't recognize a single title on the list. I just don't see how that's possible.","nextNodeIds":[706900308]},{"nodeId":706900308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":1597300434,"text":"Unless...","nextNodeIds":[706900309]},{"nodeId":706900309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1964687210,"text":"Actually, we just ran into—","nextNodeIds":[706900310]},{"nodeId":706900310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":984523498,"text":"Trouble, I presume? I think I'll steer clear, if it's all the same to you.","nextNodeIds":[706900311]},{"nodeId":706900311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":1852326146,"text":"Besides, if a book exists in this world, then there's a place for them in this library.","nextNodeIds":[706900312]},{"nodeId":706900312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":2498531666,"text":"Better for them to remain here than end up in the hands of someone more... suspect.","nextNodeIds":[706900313]},{"nodeId":706900313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","textMapHash":905192082,"text":"Anyway, here's your payment. Thanks again for all the help.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":706900305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2484966154,"text":"I'd like to ask about these books...","nextNodeIds":[706900306]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7069003,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["1007"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":1004,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7069003],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1007,"speakerName":"Lisa","count":10},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","count":2},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","count":1}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_SINGLE","BEGCMMJKCFC":[170070],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":3203987262,"CHECNJEMEFE":{"